# Terrain and placement share one grid, so the board is what it looks like.
#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: ec-03-handoff
number: 303
name: Handoff
pool: Ordinary
description: A Grappler yanks somebody up into the pit row and a Stalker, activating later in the same round, walks round and shoves them in. The telegraph you read is not the shove you get.
design: Enemy composition 3 — the Grappler delivers, the Stalker finishes.

spawn g = Grappler
spawn s = Stalker

roster a: Vanguard, Archer
roster b: Threadcaster, Wardbearer

board:
  ...g..B
  ..O..OB
  ......B
  ...H...
  .......
  A.^.^..
  AA..s..
